IMPLEMENTATION PLAN
===================

meta
  project: nexus digital agency
  tagline: we craft digital experiences that convert
  type: implementation guide with placeholder data
  structure: scalable and modular

---

PHASE 1: INITIAL SETUP EXECUTION
================================

step 1.1: create project
  command: bun create next-app nexus-agency
  selections
    typescript: no
    eslint: yes
    tailwind: yes
    src directory: no
    app router: yes
    import alias: yes, use @

step 1.2: navigate and install dependencies
  command: cd nexus-agency
  command: bun add three @react-three/fiber @react-three/drei
  command: bun add gsap @gsap/react framer-motion
  command: bun add -D @types/three

step 1.3: initialize shadcn
  command: bunx shadcn@latest init
  selections
    style: new-york
    base color: neutral
    css variables: yes

step 1.4: install initial shadcn components
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add button
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add card
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add badge
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add separator
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add sheet
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add dropdown-menu
  command: bunx shadcn@latest add switch

---

PHASE 2: FOLDER STRUCTURE CREATION
==================================

step 2.1: create all directories
  commands
    mkdir -p components/layout
    mkdir -p components/common
    mkdir -p components/three/effects
    mkdir -p components/three/scenes
    mkdir -p components/animations
    mkdir -p components/sections
    mkdir -p hooks
    mkdir -p lib
    mkdir -p providers
    mkdir -p public/models
    mkdir -p public/textures
    mkdir -p public/images
    mkdir -p data

